course: dictionary
lesson: 15748
title: Trend: a direction or a fashion
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A trend is the general direction in which something is changing. «Ice cream sales show a trend upwards every summer.» The word upwards is the clue: over time, the sales are rising, so trend means the overall direction of change.
explain: Trend can also mean a fashion or craze. «Flashing trainers are the latest trend at school.» The clue is latest: lots of people want them right now. To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence: "the latest direction at school" does not fit, but "the latest fashion at school" does.
explain: Online, trending means many people are talking about something at the same moment. «The video is trending on social media right now.» Popular is not the same as true. A trending video can still be wrong, so always check before you believe it.
fact: A trend is a general direction in which something is changing or developing.
fact: «A trend towards healthier eating» means more and more people are choosing healthy food over time.
fact: On a graph, a trend line shows the overall direction of the numbers, such as an upwards or downward trend.
fact: A fashion or craze can also be called a trend: «the latest trend».
fact: Trending online means many people are talking about something at once, but popular is not the same as true.
exercise: «Umbrella sales show a trend upwards in the wet months.» What does trend mean here? | A rainy day | *A general direction of change | A loud noise | A single sale on one day
exercise: «Flashing trainers are the latest trend at school.» What does trend mean here? | A kind of weather | A path through the woods | A type of map | *A fashion or craze
exercise: «The video is trending on social media right now.» Jayden says this means it is definitely true. What is the right answer? | Trending means it is very old | Trending means it is true, so Jayden is right | *Trending means many people are talking about it, but popular is not the same as true | Trending means it is a kind of sport
test: On a graph, what does a trend line show? | The name of the person who made the graph | *The overall direction the numbers are moving | The date the graph was printed | The colour of the axes
test: Which phrase shows a trend as a direction of change? | *A downward trend in the numbers | A trend in the paint colours | Trending now on a video | A trend of red shoes at the shop
exam: Jayden says a video is trending, so it must be true. What is the best reply? | Trending means it is true, so he is right | *It might be popular, but popular is not the same as true, so check it first | Trending means it is a kind of sport | Trending means it is old
